WEBVTT

1
00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:46.500
In the previous verse,

2
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:47.666
Lord Krishna began to

3
00:00:47.666 --> 00:00:51.208
shed light on the method of yoga

4
00:00:51.208 --> 00:00:52.875
and said that a yogi must focus

5
00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:59.458
on their spiritual journey
 alone in distant solitude.

6
00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:02.791
Now in these eleventh and twelfth verses,

7
00:01:02.791 --> 00:01:04.166
Lord Krishna explains

8
00:01:04.166 --> 00:01:08.250
what the complete process 
of yoga is in that solitude.

9
00:01:13.333 --> 00:01:14.791
Lord Krishna says

10
00:01:14.791 --> 00:01:17.708
that to practice yoga in solitude,

11
00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:19.416
a person should prepare a seat

12
00:01:19.416 --> 00:01:21.625
in a clean place.

13
00:01:21.625 --> 00:01:25.791
This place should be neither 
too high nor too low.

14
00:01:25.791 --> 00:01:27.708
And for the seat, first

15
00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:29.666
kusha grass should be spread,

16
00:01:29.666 --> 00:01:33.000
then mrigacharma, meaning deerskin,

17
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:36.625
and finally a soft cloth should be covered on it.

18
00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:40.958
The yogi must then sit firmly on this seat.

19
00:01:40.958 --> 00:01:43.791
Now here this question will certainly arise:

20
00:01:43.791 --> 00:01:47.166
are such clear instructions mandatory?

21
00:01:47.166 --> 00:01:49.500
What is their purpose?

22
00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.875
So we must understand that

23
00:01:51.875 --> 00:01:55.708
all these instructions were given
 in the time of Mahabharata,

24
00:01:55.708 --> 00:01:59.250
when there was no modern living like today.

25
00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:01.458
But every item had its own purpose.

26
00:02:01.458 --> 00:02:04.583
Kusha grass, so that the seat is soft.

27
00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:05.666
Deerskin perhaps

28
00:02:05.666 --> 00:02:08.541
so that while meditating,

29
00:02:08.541 --> 00:02:10.458
insects and creatures stay away.

30
00:02:10.458 --> 00:02:13.000
The purpose of all these instructions is only this –

31
00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.625
that these things don't disturb attention.

32
00:02:15.625 --> 00:02:17.708
And an environment can be created

33
00:02:17.708 --> 00:02:21.208
where practicing the method 
of meditation becomes easy.

34
00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:22.708
In today's modern context,

35
00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:25.833
it's only necessary to remember this:

36
00:02:25.833 --> 00:02:26.875
the place should be such

37
00:02:26.875 --> 00:02:31.458
where you can meditate without any obstacles.

38
00:02:31.458 --> 00:02:33.916
Then in the next verse, Krishna says

39
00:02:33.916 --> 00:02:36.833
that sitting firmly in such a seat,

40
00:02:36.833 --> 00:02:40.458
the yogi must focus their mind on one point.

41
00:02:40.458 --> 00:02:43.708
Keeping complete control over mind and senses,

42
00:02:43.708 --> 00:02:46.791
they must practice yoga for self-purification.

43
00:02:46.791 --> 00:02:49.375
All this will happen gradually.

44
00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:52.375
Body becomes stable, mind becomes centered –

45
00:02:52.375 --> 00:02:54.375
through continuous practice of this,

46
00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:57.291
a person can concentrate their attention

47
00:02:57.291 --> 00:03:01.041
and realize Paramātmā.

48
00:03:05.583 --> 00:03:07.708
A person's mind,

49
00:03:07.708 --> 00:03:12.500
due to its natural restlessness,

50
00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:16.625
keeps pulling in different directions all the time.

51
00:03:16.625 --> 00:03:20.583
The senses also constantly wander

52
00:03:20.583 --> 00:03:24.500
because of some attraction or repulsion,

53
00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:28.625
which disturbs attention.

54
00:03:28.625 --> 00:03:31.458
For this reason, for yoga,

55
00:03:31.458 --> 00:03:36.916
a peaceful and comfortable
 environment is essential

56
00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:40.916
where all these obstacles are reduced.

57
00:03:40.916 --> 00:03:43.375
Where at least the body

58
00:03:43.375 --> 00:03:46.750
and surrounding situation are stable.

59
00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:50.750
But it's also important to understand

60
00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.291
that the biggest challenge of yoga

61
00:03:53.291 --> 00:03:58.416
is not in physical postures or actions,

62
00:03:58.416 --> 00:04:03.083
but in handling the thoughts of the mind.

63
00:04:03.083 --> 00:04:05.750
Gradually, developing mental stability

64
00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:10.708
along with physical stability is also important.

65
00:04:10.708 --> 00:04:13.291
Whenever your mind starts to wander,

66
00:04:13.291 --> 00:04:17.375
these two things will definitely help:

67
00:04:17.375 --> 00:04:20.541
Practice of concentration:

68
00:04:20.541 --> 00:04:27.250
keep trying continuously to 
focus your attention on one point.

69
00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:29.791
Remembering the purpose:

70
00:04:29.791 --> 00:04:31.916
remember again and again

71
00:04:31.916 --> 00:04:35.083
why you are doing yoga –

72
00:04:35.083 --> 00:04:39.041
for control over the senses, purity of mind,

73
00:04:39.041 --> 00:04:43.583
and ultimately for spiritual advancement.

74
00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:46.541
Remembering this purpose is essential.

75
00:04:46.541 --> 00:04:50.208
Otherwise, many times people use yoga itself

76
00:04:50.208 --> 00:04:54.291
for wrong purposes.

77
00:04:54.291 --> 00:04:57.500
The purpose of yoga is to 
move away from materiality,

78
00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:00.500
whereas many people use it

79
00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:05.083
for material goals of making 
the body sculpted and attractive.

80
00:05:05.083 --> 00:05:08.750
The purpose of yoga is lasting inner peace,

81
00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.708
whereas many people see it

82
00:05:10.708 --> 00:05:12.500
only as a few moments of exercise

83
00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.791
or relaxation.

84
00:05:14.791 --> 00:05:18.291
Don't get lost in wrong purposes.

85
00:05:18.291 --> 00:05:19.791
Yoga is

86
00:05:19.791 --> 00:05:22.708
for clarity of mind, for inner peace,

87
00:05:22.708 --> 00:05:28.791
and ultimately, the
 meaning of the word yoga itself

88
00:05:28.791 --> 00:05:33.625
is to establish a deep
 connection with Paramātmā.

89
00:05:38.333 --> 00:05:40.625
Control of the senses

90
00:05:40.625 --> 00:05:42.875
and stability of mind –

91
00:05:42.875 --> 00:05:46.375
in family life, this is the foundation of peace

92
00:05:46.375 --> 00:05:48.375
and love.

93
00:05:48.375 --> 00:05:50.166
Yes, it's natural

94
00:05:50.166 --> 00:05:53.833
that where everyone has their own personality,

95
00:05:53.833 --> 00:05:57.041
their own thinking and values,

96
00:05:57.041 --> 00:06:00.791
there will always be some differences.

97
00:06:00.791 --> 00:06:02.333
But

98
00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:05.041
when the mind is restless, these very small

99
00:06:05.041 --> 00:06:08.916
differences take the form of big fights.

100
00:06:08.916 --> 00:06:10.666
Think –

101
00:06:10.666 --> 00:06:14.875
how many disputes arise because of this:

102
00:06:14.875 --> 00:06:16.500
You like something,

103
00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:20.000
family members like something
 else – so there's a dispute.

104
00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:23.125
A fight happens over a trivial matter

105
00:06:23.125 --> 00:06:25.708
because old doubts are still

106
00:06:25.708 --> 00:06:28.416
sitting in the mind.

107
00:06:28.416 --> 00:06:31.500
Someone doesn't follow your instructions –

108
00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.125
so discord is created.

109
00:06:34.125 --> 00:06:36.208
In such a case,

110
00:06:36.208 --> 00:06:38.458
control over mind and senses

111
00:06:38.458 --> 00:06:40.291
is extremely essential.

112
00:06:40.291 --> 00:06:43.833
When you personally gain control and peace

113
00:06:43.833 --> 00:06:47.041
through yoga,

114
00:06:47.041 --> 00:06:50.500
it has a positive effect on your family

115
00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:53.791
love and harmony too.

116
00:06:53.791 --> 00:06:57.083
Now imagine

117
00:06:57.083 --> 00:06:59.666
if other members of the family also

118
00:06:59.666 --> 00:07:03.583
start practicing yoga,

119
00:07:03.583 --> 00:07:05.333
how the atmosphere of the home

120
00:07:05.333 --> 00:07:08.958
will fill with love and peace.

121
00:07:08.958 --> 00:07:10.625
But yes,

122
00:07:10.625 --> 00:07:13.791
one thing is important to remember –

123
00:07:13.791 --> 00:07:19.375
don't let ego awaken in you.

124
00:07:19.375 --> 00:07:21.458
This also happens:

125
00:07:21.458 --> 00:07:25.250
when a person improves themselves,

126
00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.583
starts remaining calm,

127
00:07:26.583 --> 00:07:28.375
then ego of this very thing starts

128
00:07:28.375 --> 00:07:30.625
awakening: "Look!

129
00:07:30.625 --> 00:07:33.166
I am so much more peaceful than others,

130
00:07:33.166 --> 00:07:36.416
I am better than others."

131
00:07:36.416 --> 00:07:38.708
If such thoughts are coming to mind,

132
00:07:38.708 --> 00:07:41.875
then this is not yoga.

133
00:07:41.875 --> 00:07:45.125
The purpose of yoga is purification of the mind.

134
00:07:45.125 --> 00:07:48.791
The purpose of yoga is to rise above ego.

135
00:07:48.791 --> 00:07:50.166
The purpose of yoga

136
00:07:50.166 --> 00:07:54.208
is not to show yourself as better than others,

137
00:07:54.208 --> 00:07:55.500
but to truly

138
00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:58.291
make others' lives better.

139
00:07:58.291 --> 00:08:02.291
So just with such a true purpose,

140
00:08:02.291 --> 00:08:04.583
inspire your family toward spirituality

141
00:08:04.583 --> 00:08:06.916
and yoga too.

142
00:08:06.916 --> 00:08:10.541
Help them. And remember this:

143
00:08:10.541 --> 00:08:15.041
one responsibility of your spiritual progress

144
00:08:15.041 --> 00:08:19.458
that now you become a means
 of others' upliftment.

145
00:08:19.458 --> 00:08:22.791
When you do this with true heart,

146
00:08:22.791 --> 00:08:25.833
not only will your personal spiritual progress

147
00:08:25.833 --> 00:08:28.125
become more firm,

148
00:08:28.125 --> 00:08:31.375
but your love with every family member

149
00:08:31.375 --> 00:08:35.250
will also become unbreakable.

150
00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:39.041
Gradually, in the entire family, unity,

151
00:08:39.041 --> 00:08:43.375
love, and peace will start flowing.

152
00:08:43.375 --> 00:08:45.375
Imagine –

153
00:08:45.375 --> 00:08:49.041
this is the beauty of such a family

154
00:08:49.041 --> 00:08:54.583
where everyone is moving 
toward yoga and spirituality.

155
00:08:59.666 --> 00:09:01.541
In professional life,

156
00:09:01.541 --> 00:09:04.375
most people are running as if

157
00:09:04.375 --> 00:09:09.000
life itself has become a competition.

158
00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.916
People work tirelessly to achieve

159
00:09:10.916 --> 00:09:15.500
material success, honor, position, etc.

160
00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:18.291
And everywhere only noise is heard –

161
00:09:18.291 --> 00:09:19.375
noise of work,

162
00:09:19.375 --> 00:09:23.250
noise of one's victory, noise of progress.

163
00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:26.250
In such an environment, ordinarily,

164
00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:29.416
mental peace is ignored.

165
00:09:29.416 --> 00:09:32.041
Because people understand that

166
00:09:32.041 --> 00:09:36.500
one who becomes peaceful will become slow.

167
00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:39.041
And in professional context,

168
00:09:39.041 --> 00:09:43.583
there can be no bigger misconception than this.

169
00:09:43.583 --> 00:09:47.250
Because the truth is the opposite.

170
00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:48.833
Think –

171
00:09:48.833 --> 00:09:52.625
who will reach their destination quickly:

172
00:09:52.625 --> 00:09:55.333
one whose purpose is clear,

173
00:09:55.333 --> 00:09:58.333
or one who remains worried about maintaining

174
00:09:58.333 --> 00:10:01.250
their position, honor, etc.,

175
00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:05.125
along with the purpose?

176
00:10:05.125 --> 00:10:07.083
Whose speed will be faster?

177
00:10:07.083 --> 00:10:09.666
One who keeps looking here and there?

178
00:10:09.666 --> 00:10:13.583
Or one who walks straight with concentration?

179
00:10:13.583 --> 00:10:17.833
The basic mantra of success 
is not doing more work,

180
00:10:17.833 --> 00:10:21.166
but doing the right work with concentration.

181
00:10:21.166 --> 00:10:25.375
A successful person is like a yogi.

182
00:10:25.375 --> 00:10:28.625
Who is calm, concentrated, doesn't wander,

183
00:10:28.625 --> 00:10:31.708
keeps attention focused on the purpose.

184
00:10:31.708 --> 00:10:35.875
And yoga teaches many such invaluable habits.

185
00:10:35.875 --> 00:10:38.750
Amidst professional turmoil, 
it teaches emotional

186
00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:42.041
balance. Teaches concentration.

187
00:10:42.041 --> 00:10:44.583
And the biggest thing –

188
00:10:44.583 --> 00:10:47.750
yoga teaches the right definition of success.

189
00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:50.500
Success is moving toward your purpose.

190
00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.458
Reaching your destination.

191
00:10:53.458 --> 00:10:58.416
The purpose of success is not to defeat others.

192
00:10:58.416 --> 00:11:00.708
One who understands these secrets

193
00:11:00.708 --> 00:11:03.416
will gain a superior personality

194
00:11:03.416 --> 00:11:06.708
along with being a successful person.
